{"schema":"baxy.message-compose-diagnostic.v2","trace":"t9","stage":"first","intent":"conversation","language":"mixed","greeting":"none","payload_keys":["kind"],"reason":"","finish_reason":"stop","followup_subject":"","published":true,"draft_bytes":331,"draft_sha256":"3672d4f4b3a0c76736501c573d1e00a379deffc44ff6fc22d0d1c6efe4b84300","payload":{"kind":"conversation"},"situation":"{\"kind\":\"conversation\",\"polarity\":\"success\"}","draft":"Una copia de seguridad es una copia extra de tus archivos o datos que se almacenan en un lugar diferente para protegerlos en caso de pérdida o daño. That way, si tu disco falla o se borra por accidente, puedes recuperar los archivos originales sin problemas. It's like having a backup of your important files in another location."}
